    "comment_count": 1,
    "comment_data": [
        {
            "author": {
                "avatarUrl": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24854248?u=d09fd974c6720eba3039db6beb2f1c1efecdb51d&v=4",
                "login": "echasnovski",
                "resourcePath": "/echasnovski",
                "url": "https://github.com/echasnovski"
            },
            "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
            "body": "I am afraid, this is not possible with 'mini.pairs':\r\n- Both \"open\" and \"close\" parts  of a pair are expected to be a single character. More than that [is not supported](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/f1dd64cf2ac1b348bd440e59446abf680c7188d6/doc/mini-pairs.txt#L19-L20). So no \"};\" as \"close\" part is supported.\r\n- Condition on whether a pair should be included can be made [only on two character neighborhood](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/f1dd64cf2ac1b348bd440e59446abf680c7188d6/doc/mini-pairs.txt#L9-L10). So no conditions like \"it is inside a list type\" are supported.",
            "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">I am afraid, this is not possible with 'mini.pairs':</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Both \"open\" and \"close\" parts  of a pair are expected to be a single character. More than that <a href=\"https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/f1dd64cf2ac1b348bd440e59446abf680c7188d6/doc/mini-pairs.txt#L19-L20\">is not supported</a>. So no \"};\" as \"close\" part is supported.</li>\n<li>Condition on whether a pair should be included can be made <a href=\"https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/f1dd64cf2ac1b348bd440e59446abf680c7188d6/doc/mini-pairs.txt#L9-L10\">only on two character neighborhood</a>. So no conditions like \"it is inside a list type\" are supported.</li>\n</ul>",
            "bodyText": "I am afraid, this is not possible with 'mini.pairs':\n\nBoth \"open\" and \"close\" parts  of a pair are expected to be a single character. More than that is not supported. So no \"};\" as \"close\" part is supported.\nCondition on whether a pair should be included can be made only on two character neighborhood. So no conditions like \"it is inside a list type\" are supported.",
